{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2173","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Isla's Memory Thresholds"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"6 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1024 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"I hope one day, you'll be reunited with the one you cherish."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"— "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Plastic Memories"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the world of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Plastic Memories"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", Isla is collecting $$$n$$$ memory fragments. The $$$i$$$-th fragment has size $$$a_i$$$, and the sizes are "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"non-increasing"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", that is, $$$a_1 \\ge a_2 \\ge \\cdots \\ge a_n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"During retrieval, Isla processes fragments on a range and stores their sizes into a buffer. Whenever the buffer reaches a given threshold $$$x$$$, it overflows: one capsule is recorded, and the buffer is cleared to zero."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are $$$q$$$ independent queries, each described by a triple $$$(l,r,x)$$$. For each query, $$$x$$$ denotes Isla's memory capacity. Isla then picks up the $$$i$$$-th memory fragment one by one for each $$$l \\le i \\le r$$$. At any moment, if the total size of the fragments she is currently holding is at least $$$x$$$, she clears her memory completely (keeping nothing). You must determine how many times Isla clears her memory and the final sum of the size of the fragments she holds."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 1000$$$). The description of the test cases follows. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le n, q \\le 150,000$$$) — the length of $$$a$$$ and the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1,a_2,\\ldots,a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le 10^9$$$) — the elements of $$$a$$$. It is guaranteed that $$$a_1 \\ge a_2 \\ge \\cdots \\ge a_n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then $$$q$$$ lines follow, each containing three integers $$$l$$$, $$$r$$$, and $$$x$$$ ($$$1 \\le l \\le r \\le n$$$, $$$1 \\le x \\le 10^9$$$) — a query."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$150,000$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$q$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$150,000$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output two integers for each query — the number of times Isla clears her memory and the final sum of the size of the fragments she holds."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n5 4\n7 5 5 2 1\n1 3 10\n2 5 6\n1 5 7\n3 5 4\n6 5\n6 6 5 3 2 2\n1 6 2\n1 6 7\n2 6 7\n2 5 4\n2 5 3\n11 7\n938412006 792864920 746880066 729862150 704473377 550436315 381392172 326088331 316506801 301443698 190862681\n1 3 417253102\n9 11 857592497\n1 11 344359921\n1 7 408760015\n8 8 544749974\n7 10 361090133\n3 11 888178376\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1 5\n1 3\n2 3\n1 3\n6 0\n2 4\n2 0\n3 0\n3 2\n3 0\n0 808813180\n9 0\n6 381392172\n0 326088331\n2 301443698\n3 492306379\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let $$$\\texttt{cnt}$$$ be how many times Isla has cleared her memory, and $$$\\texttt{sum}$$$ be the total size of the fragments she is holding."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, for the first query $$$(l, r, x) = (1, 3, 10)$$$:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" start with $$$\\texttt{sum}=0$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" add $$$a_1=7 \\Rightarrow \\texttt{sum}=7$$$ (still $$$ \\lt 10$$$); "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" add $$$a_2=5 \\Rightarrow \\texttt{sum}=12 \\ge 10 \\Rightarrow \\texttt{sum} \\gets 0$$$, $$$\\texttt{cnt} \\gets 1$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" add $$$a_3=5 \\Rightarrow \\texttt{sum}=5$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Thus, we print $$$\\texttt{cnt}=1$$$ and $$$\\texttt{sum}=5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, for the fifth query $$$(l, r, x) = (2, 5, 3)$$$: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" start with $$$\\texttt{sum}=0$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" add $$$a_2=6 \\Rightarrow \\texttt{sum}=6 \\ge 3 \\Rightarrow \\texttt{sum} \\gets 0$$$, $$$\\texttt{cnt} \\gets 1$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" add $$$a_3=5 \\Rightarrow \\texttt{sum}=5 \\ge 3 \\Rightarrow \\texttt{sum} \\gets 0$$$, $$$\\texttt{cnt} \\gets 2$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" add $$$a_4=3 \\Rightarrow \\texttt{sum}=3 \\ge 3 \\Rightarrow \\texttt{sum} \\gets 0$$$, $$$\\texttt{cnt} \\gets 3$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" add $$$a_5=2 \\Rightarrow \\texttt{sum}=2$$$ (still $$$ \\lt 3$$$); "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":" Thus, we print $$$\\texttt{cnt}=3$$$ and $$$\\texttt{sum}=2$$$."}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"2173F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2173/problem/F"}